An advanced data visualization project built with Python and Seaborn, analyzing an e-commerce dataset of 49,000+ transaction records. The dashboard combines four distinct chart types — heatmap, violin plot, bar plot, and line plot — to uncover sales trends across product categories, cities, customer segments, payment methods, and time periods.

Key Insights Covered:
Average sales performance across categories and cities
Sales distribution across customer segments (Regular, New, VIP)
Revenue breakdown by category and payment method
Monthly sales trend over the given time period

Tech Stack:
Python
Pandas
Seaborn
Matplotlib
